<title>USA: Sigma-Aldrich declares stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Sigma-Aldrich declares stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sigma-Aldrich said Tuesday it has declared a 100 percent stock dividend by authorizing the issuance of one additional share of common stock for each share held.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be paid on January 2, 1997, to shareholders of record on December 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Sigma-Aldrich provides chemicals and products for use in research and development and manufacturing.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
